{"id":69033,"date":"2025-10-25T08:54:06","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T07:54:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69033"},"modified":"2026-10-01T09:36:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T08:36:30","slug":"sao-silvestre-alcochete","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-alcochete\/","title":{"rendered":"VI Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Alcochete 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VI Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Alcochete 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>VI Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre de Alcochete 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida agendada para as <strong>18:00<\/strong> no Largo de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o em <strong>Alcochete<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Esta emblem\u00e1tica corrida noturna celebra a \u00e9poca natal\u00edcia pelas art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas e margem ribeirinha da vila.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo contempla a prova principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong>, uma corrida acess\u00edvel de <strong>5 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> para todas as idades, al\u00e9m da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Kids<\/strong> (400m e 700m). O evento conta com abastecimentos no percurso e meta, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha a todos os finalistas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A iniciativa \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Alcochete<\/strong>, com o apoio do movimento associativo e for\u00e7as de seguran\u00e7a, garantindo rigor log\u00edstico e um ambiente de festa para toda a fam\u00edlia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;